<section class="container editor-page"><a class="back-link" href="/admin">← Dashboard pengelola</a><h1><%= material.id?'Edit materi.':'Materi baru.' %></h1><% if(error){ %><div class="alert" role="alert"><%= error %></div><% } %><form action="/admin/materi" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" class="form"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="<%= material.id||'' %>"><label>Judul<input name="title" value="<%= material.title||'' %>" maxlength="200" required></label><label>Ringkasan publik<textarea name="summary" rows="3" maxlength="600" required><%= material.summary||'' %></textarea><small>Ditampilkan kepada semua pengunjung, termasuk untuk materi premium.</small></label><div class="form-row"><label>Penulis<input name="author" value="<%= material.author||'Tim Editorial' %>" maxlength="100" required></label><label>Topik<select name="topic"><% topics.forEach(t=>{ %><option <%= material.topic===t?'selected':'' %>><%= t %></option><% }) %></select></label></div><div class="form-row"><label>Jenis materi<select name="kind"><% ['Artikel','Bedah Putusan','Kelas','Makalah'].forEach(k=>{ %><option <%= material.kind===k?'selected':'' %>><%= k %></option><% }) %></select></label><label>Akses<select name="access"><option value="public" <%= material.access==='public'?'selected':'' %>>Publik / gratis</option><option value="premium" <%= material.access==='premium'?'selected':'' %>>Profesional / premium</option></select></label></div><label>Isi materi<textarea class="body-editor" name="body" rows="18" maxlength="100000" required><%= material.body||'' %></textarea><small>Gunakan baris kosong untuk memisahkan paragraf. Teks ditampilkan aman tanpa menjalankan HTML.</small></label><div class="form-row"><label>Nama sumber<input name="source_label" maxlength="150" value="<%= material.source_label||'' %>"></label><label>Tautan sumber<input name="source_url" type="url" maxlength="1500" value="<%= material.source_url||'' %>"></label></div><label>Dokumen / rekaman <span class="muted">(opsional, maksimal 100 MB)</span><input name="attachment" type="file" accept=".pdf,.docx,.pptx,.mp4,.mp3"><small>PDF, Word (DOCX), slide (PPTX), video (MP4), atau audio (MP3). Video dan audio dapat diputar di halaman materi.</small><% if(material.attachment_name){ %><small>Saat ini: <%= material.attachment_name %>. Upload baru akan menggantikan lampiran.</small><% } %></label><label>Status<select name="status"><option value="draft" <%= material.status==='draft'?'selected':'' %>>Simpan sebagai draf</option><option value="published" <%= material.status==='published'?'selected':'' %>>Terbitkan</option></select></label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="reviewed" value="yes"><span>Saya telah meninjau isi, rujukan, identitas penulis, dan izin publikasi. Materi atas nama profesor sudah mendapat persetujuan beliau. Wajib untuk menerbitkan.</span></label><div class="editor-actions"><button class="button">Simpan materi ↗</button><a href="/admin">Batal</a></div></form></section>
